# Transpiled shaders - generated from shaders/src/templates by compile.bat.
# Ignore the generated output directories only. Do NOT ignore *.vert / *.frag
# globally: that kept every hand-written GLSL source out of version control,
# and triangle.vert (the vertex shader for the only pipeline that draws the
# planet) was lost that way.
shaders/src/vertex/
shaders/src/fragment/

